# ---- Asset Store / package tooling ----
/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

# ---- Vendored assets (excluded from version control) ----
# Purchased/imported art packs stay machine-local; anything a shipped scene or
# skin needs is COPIED into committed _COREHOLD folders (the Skin From Kit tool
# does this for UI sprites). Committing whole kits bloats the repo and invites
# the dangling-GUID trap on other machines.
/[Aa]ssets/Vendor/
/[Aa]ssets/Vendor.meta
/[Aa]ssets/Yoge/
/[Aa]ssets/Yoge.meta
/[Aa]ssets/Layer Lab/
/[Aa]ssets/Layer Lab.meta

